<title>HONG KONG: Great Eagle interim net up 15.59 pct.</title>
<headline>Great Eagle interim net up 15.59 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended March 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   160.0	 vs 142.0</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    21.0	  vs 19.5</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  123.98 gain vs 339.46 gain</p>
<p>    Net			    736.42	vs 637.10</p>
<p>    Turnover		     1,934.39    vs 1,337.40</p>
<p>    Company name		 Great Eagle Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  July 9-15</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   July 22</p>
<p>NOTE - Investment holding and property development firm Great Eagle Holdings provides building materials and property management services.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional gain on disposal of investment properties.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368.  http://www.hk97.com</p>
